# One line per file, sorted (scripts/mutation-floorfile.ts): two branches that
# add a floor at the same place keep both lines. A file that both branches
# changed then has two lines; every reader refuses that by name, and the
# order is fixed with `node scripts/mutation-floors.ts --format`. GitHub's own
# merge ignores this line: a pull request whose floors conflict is merged
# with main on the command line (okf/ops/testing.md).
mutation-floors.txt merge=union
